{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Meghiya","html":"<article id='thag1.66'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.66 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.66 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Sattamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Seven </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Meghiyattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Meghiya </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Anusāsi mahāvīro, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>He counseled me, the great hero, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sabbadhammāna pāragū; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>the one who has gone beyond all things. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tassāhaṁ dhammaṁ sutvāna, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>When I heard his teaching </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>vihāsiṁ santike sato; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I stayed close by him, mindful. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tisso vijjā anuppattā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’ve attained the three knowledges </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kataṁ buddhassa sāsanan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>and fulfilled the Buddha’s instructions. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Meghiyo thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
